entries[221952] = { ["name"] = "Prototype: Convincingly Realistic Jumper Cables", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique: Prototype (1)\nUse: Frighten a \"dead\" ally with the threat of an electric shock, restoring them to \"life\" with 35% health and 10% mana. Sometimes you fail to make a compelling case.\n\nCastable in combat. Item quality affects cast time. Cannot be used by players higher than level 80. (10 Min Cooldown)\nRequires Khaz Algar Engineering (1)\n\"Sometimes they're just faking it.\"\nSell Price:" }
