entries[223138] = { ["name"] = "Formula: Enchant Cloak - Chant of Winged Grace", ["text"] = "Use: Teaches you how to perform the Chant of Winged Grace enchantment.\nNerubian Novelties - Tertiary Trivialities\n\nPermanently enchants a cloak with ancient magic that chants with power, granting 380 Avoidance and reducing fall damage by 0%. Cannot be applied to items lower than level 350.\nRequires Khaz Algar Enchanting (25)\nSell Price:" }
